flowchart TD
    PR[Pull request] --> Validate[Format, lint and validate]
    Validate --> Scan[Security and policy scan]
    Scan --> Plan[Plan or what-if]
    Plan --> Review[Review and merge]
    Review --> Test[Deploy to test]
    Test --> Smoke[Smoke tests]
    Smoke --> Gate[Production approval]
    Gate --> Prod[Deploy production]
    Prod --> Evidence[Health checks and deployment evidence]
    Identity[Federated workload identity] --> Test
    Identity --> Prod
